      "releaseNotes": "Pocket Mac now feels at home on iPhone, iPad and iPhone Duo.\n\n• Dedicated iPhone and iPad layouts with a full desktop, trackpad and floating keyboard.\n• New optional scroll wheel for scrolling without accidental taps.\n• Improved mouse alignment, click handling and keyboard shortcuts.\n• Refined Mac audio playback and connection recovery.\n• Pinch where you want to zoom, then explore with two fingers.\n• Easier companion setup and switching between Mac monitors.\n• Studio Space Black and refinements to the Duo collection.\n\nUpdate your Mac companion from the app for the best experience.",
